OL,3,AAndrew takes legal action over search
OL,4,Awarrants before his arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountbatten-Windsor's lawyers are
OL,7,Funderstood to be challenging the
OL,8,Flawfulness of search warrants used for
OL,9,FSandringham and at Royal Lodge in
OL,10,FWindsor relating to his arrest, as
OL,11,Ffirst reported by the Telegraph.
OL,13,FThames Valley Police confirmed: "We are
OL,14,Fengaged in legal proceedings in
OL,15,Frelation to warrants previously
OL,16,Fobtained from the Central Criminal
OL,17,FCourt."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
