OL,3,ATwelve arrests after protest over
OL,4,Amigrant boat arrival
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven men and one woman were arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of offences including
OL,8,Fassaulting police officers, affray and
OL,9,Fracially aggravated public order. All
OL,10,Fremain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
